***Controller (Driver Controller):***
Button B: Reset Gyro
Left Bumper: Pulls Climber Down
Right Bumper: Lifts Climber Up
Left Trigger: Runs Kicker **ONLY A TEST FOR THE MOTOR TO SEE IF IT WORKS**
Right Trigger: Drive To Climb Command
Button X: Switches to X Pattern

Button Y: Shooter open-loop test at 30% duty cycle (hardware test - hold to spin motor bypassing PID)
Button A: (available)


***Controller1 (Operator Controller):***
Button Y: Starts Running Shooter Motor
Right Trigger: Run IntakeRoller
Button A: Deploy Intake (With PID)
Button B: Stow Intake (With PID)
Button X: Deploy Agitator

